Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:31.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, these Ishbalans are just refugees, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:36.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Scar is among them, \Nthen it's a different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.25,0:00:38.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if that's true, \Nisn't this a bit much?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:41.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? Are you criticizing our superiors, \NSergeant Fuery?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:43.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:47.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our ultimate objective \Nis to secure Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.78,0:00:50.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's likely that we won't \Nmeet with any resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:54.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what if we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.95,0:00:59.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, we have information that before we were posted there,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:04.46,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,the Ishbalan refugees were attacked in Central by thugs who claimed to be the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.92,0:01:07.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying, they may not have too much trust in the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.09,0:01:45.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those markings...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.11,0:01:51.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.86,0:01:56.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.11,0:02:01.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:07.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.40,0:03:48.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.49,0:03:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zolf J. Kimbly! \NHow are you still alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.76,0:03:52.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kimbly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.22,0:03:54.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Crimson Alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:57.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A State Alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:04:00.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were supposed to have been executed a long time ago
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:02.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for your multiple violations of orders at Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:04.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can come right out and say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:07.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I indiscriminately made women and children go "boom."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:10.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And when my superiors \Ntried to stop me, they also went...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.21,0:04:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Boom!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:16.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was certain I would be looking forward to an execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.37,0:04:18.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But for some reason, \NI was kept alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:20.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.39,0:04:24.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who can say? The gentleman standing there would know, wouldn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.35,0:04:27.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How am I supposed to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:30.58,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,How long are you going to allow this disturbance to persist inside the command center?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:33.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arrest them! Take them all into custody at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:34.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.17,0:04:36.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:41.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please wait, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:49.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:54.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:04:57.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a homunculus, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:04:59.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.29,0:05:00.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's magnificent too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:13.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A superb transmutation!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:16.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But those who would dare lay a hand on the Führer...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:22.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,must meet with defeat by \Nmy own artful transmutations!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:35.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd give me \Nsome more credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:39.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm used to seeing muscles, \Nones more handsome than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.61,0:05:50.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, if we don't stop those two fast, the whole building will be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.06,0:05:52.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they're not careful, \Nthis town's going to cease to exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:58.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:02.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Interesting body you have there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He caused an explosion \Nout of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:13.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've heard about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:18.21,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,It's an alchemy where he transmutes the materials within a body into something similar to explosives,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:21.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then quickly contracts them \Nto create an enormous explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:26.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you interfering with us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.36,0:06:29.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We want that child too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.75,0:06:34.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, our boss has \Nsome business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:37.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:54.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a second! Don't tell me you're planning to turn me into a bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:55.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean I can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:57.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:18.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did Fullmetal tell you that that was his arm and leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:19.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:23.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you passed through the doorway under your own power?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:25.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doorway? Doorway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.69,0:07:26.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:29.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Starting today, \Nyou're no longer alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:30.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.11,0:07:32.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,eat these.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.27,0:07:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:52.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enjoy them well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:56.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've got several hundred human lives \Npacked inside them, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.84,0:07:59.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Human...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:04.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? \NYou don't like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.54,0:08:07.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. Well, that leaves us with no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:11.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can just return the arm and leg \Nthat you took from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:25.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can use alchemy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.43,0:08:29.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it, it's because of that arm and leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:36.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, we're raised on \Nthese stones of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:39.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We aren't human. \NWe're homunculi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.41,0:08:42.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fact that you can eat those...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:44.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,means that you aren't human either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.21,0:09:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, we'll have to ask Greed-sama himself to step in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:04.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.43,0:09:09.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, well, maybe I should \Nblow the whole building up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.41,0:09:15.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am Lt. Col. Frank Archer. \NCrimson Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:17.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.93,0:09:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're here like this, then it must \Nmean that the Führer has agreed to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:26.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or was this at Basque Grand's discretion?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:27.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:31.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have no intention of \Nreturning to military duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.15,0:09:35.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:41.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei! Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:41.68,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Sensei! Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.90,0:09:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That bastard! \NHe scratched me good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.38,0:09:50.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, yow-ow-ow-ow! \NThis is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.35,0:09:55.34,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,I should have expected the master of the \NElric brothers to be able to take me unawares!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:58.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:10:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought it might \Nturn out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.80,0:10:03.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your hand should be \Non the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:20.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This boy is no longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.04,0:10:40.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:43.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.76,0:10:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, it doesn't look like Sensei is here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.50,0:10:58.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.81,0:11:01.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is she so caught up in that boy, considering the shape her body is in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.98,0:11:04.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two go around to the south! The rest of you come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.27,0:11:06.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go. We're trespassers here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.96,0:11:09.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Colonel's going to make more snide remarks about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:14.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Verify that once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.06,0:11:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you know whether or not \Nthe Führer is safe yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:23.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just it. When we contacted Central,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:26.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they told us that the Führer was not scheduled to come down south.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:28.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impossible! We saw him with our own...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.35,0:11:32.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you taken the Elric brothers and that woman into custody?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.81,0:11:37.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I thought it was more urgent \Nto secure this crumbling building,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:39.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:40.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:42.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.93,0:11:46.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those two don't have anywhere else to return to besides the military, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.63,0:11:50.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Just in case, have everyone look one more time for the Führer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:51.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.70,0:11:57.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You know where Sensei is, don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:12:01.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, tell us. We're concerned about her condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:05.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more, that child is a homunculus, and there's no telling what he'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:10.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The place where she performed human transmutation...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.49,0:12:15.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi-san lost her child there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.43,0:12:19.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She then transmuted his body, to try to bring him back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.89,0:12:21.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you know that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.48,0:12:24.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:29.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's gone to the same place this time. That's my hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:31.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The place Sensei would choose...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.47,0:12:33.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where she wouldn't do damage to the surrounding area...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.53,0:12:35.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where no one else would go...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:37.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yock Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.63,0:12:39.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.24,0:13:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My son...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.85,0:14:01.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:05.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.01,0:14:06.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:12.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:21.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.38,0:14:23.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.09,0:14:23.75,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.37,0:14:27.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:30.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:35.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:41.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:44.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:49.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.57,0:14:50.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.73,0:14:53.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that boy was going to kill you, Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.53,0:14:57.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was planning to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:15:01.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm the one \Nwho should have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.57,0:15:02.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:06.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who created him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.31,0:15:12.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I added some other materials to my dead baby's remains
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:14.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and attempted a \Nhuman transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.97,0:15:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what was born...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.93,0:15:19.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.39,0:15:23.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't... human.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.18,0:15:47.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I came to, I was in front of the gateway once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.21,0:15:51.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed, what did you see on \Nthe other side of the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:54.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything that is alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:16:00.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It felt as though all the reasoning \Nof the world was pouring into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:03.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The truth was in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.07,0:16:06.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The truth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:10.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To me, it looked like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.87,0:16:13.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I placed the boy there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.35,0:16:48.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there's no way this boy could be that child.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:51.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I recognized him in one glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.96,0:16:55.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he had continued to grow, \Nhe would've been exactly the same age.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.87,0:17:00.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Most of all, for a homunculus to appear in this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:02.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it would have to be the boy \NI left behind then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.84,0:17:05.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a homunculus!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:08.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A man-made person, \Nsomething that somebody created!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:09.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Created?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:14.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know how \Nhomunculi are created?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:16.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:20.76,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,But it's probably the same way Chimera are created, \Nin places like the 5th Laboratory!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.27,0:17:24.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:24.06,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.84,0:17:30.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When worthless humans like you perform human transmutations for the hell of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.39,0:17:34.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what is born as a result \Nis a soulless reject,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.79,0:17:38.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,furnished with only \Na body and a mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:41.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what you guys \Ncall a homunculus!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:45.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you know \Nsomething like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.05,0:17:51.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was forced to remember it, by Envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.25,0:17:53.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Envy? You've met with him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:55.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:59.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Envy and all the others were born long ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.36,0:18:03.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,thanks to some idiot somewhere performing human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.86,0:18:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why we all \Nwant to become human.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:22.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shall we get going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.83,0:18:25.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well if isn't the Mightiest Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo, Mightiest—er, was it "Monster" that you liked to be called?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:37.13,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Even after being locked away for a century, \Nit appears you still haven't learned, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:38.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you'll have to excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:40.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was that joke too old?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:43.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know any \Npresent-day ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:45.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to the skull?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:48.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I destroyed it, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.48,0:18:51.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right? You put it away someplace safe, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:54.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once I find it, I'll lock you away once again without delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:56.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As if I'd let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.05,0:19:08.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It appears that there really is a new member around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:10.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's got nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:13.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I would like to \Ngo on living, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.85,0:19:16.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need \Nfriends to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.67,0:19:18.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're late to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.23,0:19:33.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sloth...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.12,0:19:36.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sloth? So, someone with that name \Nhas been born, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.45,0:19:39.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a new Lust as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.38,0:19:42.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means that for the first time \Nin a while, all seven of us are around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:46.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you, Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:48.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is an honor to make \Nyour acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.49,0:19:54.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I may be greedy, \Nbut I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:58.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of \Nfighting against two homunculi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:00.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:06.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll deal with him later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:07.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Wrath?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:10.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, right about now, \Nhe's with the Fullmetal boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.10,0:20:15.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You maneuvered him into a \Nconfrontation with Edward Elric?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.73,0:20:17.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were supposed to use Wrath to lure those two
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,toward the Philosopher's Stone once again, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:27.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see Fullmetal's—that dirty bastard's child's face tense with fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.30,0:20:34.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything—I remember it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:38.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the other side of that door, \Nthe only thing I could do was wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:41.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just wait and wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.09,0:20:44.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, my body \Ngrew bigger, little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:47.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then this one time, \Na fool came by.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.13,0:20:51.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That fool came to leave \Nhis arm and leg at the doorway,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.59,0:20:54.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,shouting for his brother to be returned to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.11,0:20:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, I took that arm and leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.44,0:21:05.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then, after another long while, \NI opened the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had finally come out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.78,0:21:11.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not true...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.90,0:21:13.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the arm and leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.66,0:21:17.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the incomplete life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.89,0:21:21.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so thankful that no matter how much I might hate you, it's still not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:26.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, give me all of your body!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.01,0:21:28.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I will become human!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.42,0:21:39.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That stung. I don't want {\i1}your{\i0} body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:43.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, if you're not \Ngoing to fight, then I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.14,0:21:46.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, stop! That boy isn't—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:47.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.23,0:21:52.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This boy's right arm and left leg \Nbelong to Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:54.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He lost them for my sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.65,0:21:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.03,0:21:59.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The whole reason \Nwe've been traveling...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:02.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is to get them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.84,0:23:40.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.62,0:23:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 32: "Dante of the Deep Forest"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.94,0:23:46.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.19,0:23:48.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,also known as the Mightiest Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.19,0:23:51.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is a homunculus.
